      "content": "The current employee feedback indicates several key areas requiring executive attention to enhance our internal culture. There are specific concerns regarding inconsistent remote work application and noticeable gaps in the diversity of senior leadership. Additionally, while overall personal acceptance is reported, meeting dynamics suggest challenges around equitable voice distribution, and there are critical accessibility needs within current internal tools. These insights point toward a need for strategic involvement in policy standardization and iterative platform improvement.",
      "source": "target",
